omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hM8YfdgaxP4Q7kNvwFk5J3O&_nc_oc=Adr7Tta5OlYpbG8OsxRFalB8z4W2rplbnjA4rH6cPY6BRalt6LMqfTwEV-t5THXqxBI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEi_d5M7XWYB-_-gMJr1jVxEpOJv1rCHiaE8tqrCnSwjA&oe=6A92C0F4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=R5sPvZAx93gQ7kNvwH0uB4j&_nc_oc=Adr3UGScce47jqKSvPj7xTp5bu6PkeVZXTpp1fgOwGBdYVojKKpAGpod-2yEbNXxoIs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFs5EN48xpa8Rm5HM8oRkEvTGfUacCpfaia_-D5b8sHIw&oe=6A92C256"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zV1YxhWFSoYQ7kNvwEG6EC5&_nc_oc=AdrTY3AvYMJT22VFWsgwoop0y1n3L56oAx4xIFDBtlkD34wHXbiBb5BT3n3Q1TKmPpo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGjUkEbZLY1SgaFld1HILh26Ezim1z0YbqmfsNZf4djMA&oe=6A92D777"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://